# Shipped font bakes -- consumed by the ship pipeline's cook stage (dev_ship).
#
#   <family> <size_px> [-sdf[=n]] [-range=<spec>]
#
# <family> is a font_tool input: a TTF in assets/font_source, or an OS-installed face name
# (wrap names containing spaces in double quotes).  Flags pass through to font_tool verbatim.
# Each line bakes one .orb_font into assets/font/ (FreeType quality), which the stage step
# ships wholesale.  The gui font resolver finds these by filename, so a size listed here is
# available to shipped builds (which install no runtime baker).

JetBrainsMonoNL-Regular 12
JetBrainsMonoNL-Regular 16
JetBrainsMonoNL-Regular 20
JetBrainsMonoNL-Regular 24
JetBrainsMonoNL-Regular 32
Roboto-Regular 12
Roboto-Regular 16
Roboto-Regular 20
Roboto-Regular 24
Roboto-Regular 32
CascadiaMono 12
CascadiaMono 16
CascadiaMono 20
CascadiaMono 24
CascadiaMono 32
CascadiaCode 16
